# Subagent models

When you launch a subagent, including with the Task tool, that subagent must run as a Cursor Grok model or a Composer model.

Allowed model slugs are only those whose names start with `cursor-grok-`, `grok-`, or `composer-`.

Do not launch a subagent on Claude, GPT, Gemini, Muse, or any other model family.

Pass `model` explicitly as one of the allowed slugs. Do not omit `model` when that would inherit a parent model outside the allowed families.

If the user names a model outside those families for a subagent, do not substitute a different model. Say that this rule only allows Cursor Grok and Composer, and name those families.
